        "# Advisory: multi-user.target.upholds/driftify-upheld.service is not carried: the unit's [Install] section cannot be relied on (UpheldBy=, which systemctl enable on systemd 254 or later turns into an .upholds link).",
        "#   An .upholds link starts driftify-upheld.service while multi-user.target is active and restarts it whenever it stops, so adding it for a unit that becomes inactive after it exits, such as a oneshot service without RemainAfterExit=yes, produces a restart loop. To add it, put Upholds=driftify-upheld.service in a drop-in for multi-user.target."
      ],
